@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 10

title Flujo MQTT Send: Puente DDS → MQTT\nOpenICE Medical Device Data → Mosquitto Broker

box "Dispositivos Médicos" #LightGray
    participant "Device Adapter\n(Simulador/Real)" as Device
end box

box "Middleware DDS (RTI Connext)" #LightGray
    participant "DomainParticipant\n(Subscriber DDS)" as DDS
    participant "NumericTopic\nSampleArrayTopic\nPatientAlertTopic\nTechnicalAlertTopic" as Topics
end box

box "MQTT Send App (JavaFX)" #LightBlue
    participant "MqttSendFactory\n(IceApplicationProvider)" as Factory
    participant "MqttSend\n(Controller FXML)" as Controller
    participant "NumericFxList\nSampleArrayFxList\nAlertFxList" as FxLists
    participant "MqttClient\n(Eclipse Paho)" as Paho
end box

box "Mosquitto Broker" #LightGreen
    participant "MQTT Broker\n(tcp://localhost:1883)" as Broker
end box

box "Subscriber Externo" #LightYellow
    participant "MQTT Client\n(mosquitto_sub / App)" as Subscriber
end box

== 1. Inicialización (al abrir MQTT Send) ==

Factory -> Controller: new
activate Controller

Controller -> FxLists: new NumericFxList(NumericTopic.VALUE)
Controller -> FxLists: new SampleArrayFxList(SampleArrayTopic.VALUE)
Controller -> FxLists: new AlertFxList(PatientAlertTopic.VALUE)
Controller -> FxLists: new AlertFxList(TechnicalAlertTopic.VALUE)

Controller -> DDS: numericList.start(subscriber, eventLoop, ...)
Controller -> DDS: sampleArrayList.start(subscriber, eventLoop, ...)
Controller -> DDS: patientAlertList.start(subscriber, eventLoop, ...)
Controller -> DDS: technicalAlertList.start(subscriber, eventLoop, ...)

Controller -> Controller: registrar ListChangeListeners\n(onNumericChanged, onSampleArrayChanged, onAlertChanged)

Controller -> Controller: bindDeviceList(deviceListModel)\nMostrar dispositivos conectados en UI

deactivate Controller

== 2. Conexión MQTT (usuario hace click "Connect") ==

Controller -> Paho: new MqttClient(broker, clientId, persistence)
Controller -> Paho: connect(opts)\n(cleanSession=true, autoReconnect=true)
Paho -> Broker: CONNECT\n(username/password si aplica)
Broker --> Paho: CONNACK
Controller -> Controller: connected = true

note right of Controller
  **IMPORTANTE:** Al conectar se ejecuta:
  1. publishAllExistingData() - envía todo lo que ya existe
  2. startPeriodicRepublish() - reenvía cada 5 segundos
end note

Controller -> Paho: publishAllExistingData()
activate Paho
    loop Para cada NumericFx en numericList
        Paho -> Paho: publishNumeric(fx)
        Paho -> Broker: PUBLISH\nopenice/{udi}/{metric_id}\nQoS=1, retain=false
    end
    loop Para cada SampleArrayFx en sampleArrayList
        Paho -> Paho: publishSampleArray(fx)
        Paho -> Broker: PUBLISH\nopenice/{udi}/{metric_id}\nQoS=1, retain=false
    end
    loop Para cada AlertFx en patientAlertList
        Paho -> Paho: publishAlert(fx, "patient_alert")
        Paho -> Broker: PUBLISH\nopenice/{udi}/patient_alert\nQoS=1, retain=false
    end
    loop Para cada AlertFx en technicalAlertList
        Paho -> Paho: publishAlert(fx, "technical_alert")
        Paho -> Broker: PUBLISH\nopenice/{udi}/technical_alert\nQoS=1, retain=false
    end
deactivate Paho

== 3. Subscriber se conecta ==

Subscriber -> Broker: CONNECT\n(clientId, username, password)
Broker --> Subscriber: CONNACK
Subscriber -> Broker: SUBSCRIBE\nopenice/#\n(QoS=1)

note over Broker, Subscriber
  **Topic filter:** El subscriber usa `openice/#` para recibir
  TODOS los mensajes publicados bajo el prefijo `openice`.
  Formato de topic: `openice/{device_udi}/{metric_id}`
end note

== 4. Flujo continuo de datos (DDS → MQTT) ==

loop Cada ciclo de datos DDS (varios Hz)
    Device -> DDS: write(Numeric/SampleArray/Alert)
    DDS -> Topics: notificar DATA_AVAILABLE
    Topics -> FxLists: on_data_available → update FxList
    FxLists -> Controller: ListChangeListener dispara\n(onNumericChanged / onSampleArrayChanged / onAlertChanged)

    Controller -> Paho: publishNumeric(fx) / publishSampleArray(fx) / publishAlert(fx)
    Paho -> Broker: PUBLISH\nopenice/{udi}/{metric_id}\nQoS=1
    Broker -> Subscriber: MESSAGE\nopenice/{udi}/{metric_id}
    Subscriber -> Subscriber: messageArrived()\n imprimir [RECIBIDO] contenido
end

== 5. Republish periódico (cada 5 segundos) ==

loop Cada 5 segundos (ScheduledExecutorService)
    Controller -> Paho: publishAllExistingData()
    Paho -> Broker: PUBLISH (todos los datos actuales)\nopenice/{udi}/{metric_id}\nQoS=1
    Broker -> Subscriber: MESSAGE (datos frescos)
end

note over Controller, Subscriber
  **Republish periódico** garantiza que si un subscriber
  se conecta después del inicio, recibe datos frescos.
end note

== 6. Desconexión ==

Controller -> Paho: disconnect()
Paho -> Broker: DISCONNECT
Controller -> Controller: connected = false\nstopPeriodicRepublish()
Controller -> Controller: cleanup

@enduml
